{"2984970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Curiosity: A Cat Climbing Game", "steam_appid": 2984970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/2586743d3502d9bbb6a28538885d72bc.poster.avif?t=1762537472\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/2586743d3502d9bbb6a28538885d72bc.webm?t=1762537472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/2586743d3502d9bbb6a28538885d72bc.mp4?t=1762537472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on an exciting journey as a determined cat searching their memories to find their way home. Experience an incredible climb overcoming many challenges, having plenty of laughs, and perhaps meeting a cat or two along the way. <strong><i>Don't forget to bring your curiosity.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/9711f014fe2dcd6d99f7e8eca9cadc24.avif?t=1762537472\" width=1035 height=89 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/16512d6720ceda433a5ee212ee7044ac.poster.avif?t=1762537472\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/16512d6720ceda433a5ee212ee7044ac.webm?t=1762537472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/16512d6720ceda433a5ee212ee7044ac.mp4?t=1762537472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Pounce around with intuitive cat-like agility. <strong>Wall-run</strong> across impossible gaps, <strong>cling</strong> to precarious ledges, and save your falls by <strong>mantling</strong> sharp  surfaces. Every action flows naturally as you ascend through beautifully hand-crafted levels that challenge your reflexes while celebrating your success. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/7a938a5d37621d57c5f75c2414f79296.avif?t=1762537472\" width=1035 height=89 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/78c7c863f4875519d6742b53df501ba5.poster.avif?t=1762537472\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/78c7c863f4875519d6742b53df501ba5.webm?t=1762537472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/78c7c863f4875519d6742b53df501ba5.mp4?t=1762537472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Take control of your adventure with a convenient checkpoint system. Place cozy beds anywhere you choose - before a tricky jump, after a hard-won climb, or wherever feels right. Fall? No problem. Simply curl up and dream yourself back to your bed. With 9 lives to spend and more to discover at Lost Cats Cafés scattered throughout your journey, you create your difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <i><u></u></i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/5b0648879cd0370dee775b9b176f2d05.avif?t=1762537472\" width=920 height=89 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/215fba01f72c6ce9872781a6ca30dfd3.poster.avif?t=1762537472\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/215fba01f72c6ce9872781a6ca30dfd3.webm?t=1762537472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/215fba01f72c6ce9872781a6ca30dfd3.mp4?t=1762537472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A Journey Worth Taking:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Touching Narrative:</strong> Experience a kitty's memories with their beloved owner through each lovingly crafted level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Customization:</strong> Collect coins to unlock adorable hats, backpacks, shoes, and unique fur patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges Galore:</strong> Test your skills with an array of unique challenges and milk-delivery speedruns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your choices and exploration shape your cat's ultimate fate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star-Studded Cast:</strong> Featuring voice performances by incredible individuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Depths:</strong> Discover a series of secrets to uncover the story behind your grand adventure</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're new to platformers or a seasoned climber, our forgiving checkpoint system ensures you can enjoy the journey at your own pace. Challenge yourself as much or as little as you want - the path home is yours to define. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.aka