e cozy beds anywhere you choose - before a tricky jump, after a hard-won climb, or wherever feels right. Fall? No problem. Simply curl up and dream yourself back to your bed. With 9 lives to spend and more to discover at Lost Cats Cafés scattered throughout your journey, you create your difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <i><u></u></i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/5b0648879cd0370dee775b9b176f2d05.avif?t=1762537472\" width=920 height=89 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/215fba01f72c6ce9872781a6ca30dfd3.poster.avif?t=1762537472\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/215fba01f72c6ce9872781a6ca30dfd3.webm?t=1762537472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/215fba01f72c6ce9872781a6ca30dfd3.mp4?t=1762537472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A Journey Worth Taking:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Touching Narrative:</strong> Experience a kitty's memories with their beloved owner through each lovingly crafted level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Customization:</strong> Collect coins to unlock adorable hats, backpacks, shoes, and unique fur patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges Galore:</strong> Test your skills with an array of unique challenges and milk-delivery speedruns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your choices and exploration shape your cat's ultimate fate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star-Studded Cast:</strong> Featuring voice performances by incredible individuals</p></l